   Kind of conflicting sequence of messages there, eh? <laugh!>


Session 16:
-----------

   Completed the sixth and fifth level puzzles. The last level was the
same as my last game. So it took less long than expected.

   Well... Hard to gauge an "expected" time frame, I suppose. But, it
went well once I remembered (or figured out again) that; I had to
